(# Welcome to Mintware) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Mintware is a DeFi reputation and rewards platform built for EVM chains.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(We turn your on-chain history into a verifiable score ? then use that score to determine ) Tj
T*
(how much you earn from campaigns, liquidity pools, and protocol incentives. The better ) Tj
T*
(your on-chain track record, the more your activity is worth.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Mintware is also designed to make on-chain actions easier to understand before you commit.) Tj
T*
( Swaps, claims, and funding actions now surface clearer confirmation context, stronger ) Tj
T*
(chain guidance, and better fee visibility before your wallet opens.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Three Products, One Stack) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### Attribution ? On-Chain Reputation) Tj
T*
(A live scoring engine that analyses your full wallet history across 100+ chains and ) Tj
T*
(produces a single composite reputation score. Your score reflects the depth, consistency, ) Tj
T*
(and quality of your on-chain behaviour ? not just your balance.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### Campaigns ? Earn from Your Activity) Tj
T*
(A rewards engine where protocols deposit tokens or points budgets, and Attribution score ) Tj
T*
(determines how large a share you earn. Three campaign types: Token Reward Pools, Points ) Tj
T*
(Campaigns, and AI Agent Campaigns.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Campaign and claim flows are designed to be clearer and safer, with better step guidance, ) Tj
T*
(fewer unnecessary approval prompts, and stronger transaction checks before submission.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### Mintware Swap ? Clearer Before You Confirm) Tj
T*
(Mintware Swap is built to reduce confusion before the wallet popup appears.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Depending on the route and token pair, Mintware can show:) Tj
T*
(- what you are sending) Tj
T*
(- what you are expected to receive) Tj
T*
(- estimated network fees) Tj
T*
(- route and chain context) Tj
T*
(- warnings for missing gas balance or unusual price impact) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### Social Liquidity Vaults *\(Coming Soon\)*) Tj
T*
(LP vaults built on Uniswap V4 where your share of the fee pool is weighted by your ) Tj
T*
(Attribution score and referral network. The same deposit earns more if you've built a ) Tj
T*
(stronger on-chain reputation.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Vault flows are also being built with clearer staged guidance around approvals, deposits, ) Tj
T*
(and higher-trust actions.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
