(# What is Mintware?) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Mintware solves a fundamental problem in DeFi incentives: protocols can't tell who their ) Tj
T*
(best users actually are.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Today, most protocols distribute rewards equally ? or proportional to capital. A whale who) Tj
T*
( dumped last cycle gets the same incentives as a genuine long-term user. Sybil farmers get) Tj
T*
( the same as real participants.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Mintware fixes this by introducing **reputation as a first-class primitive**.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## The Core Idea) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Your wallet has a history. That history tells a story ? when you started, how consistently) Tj
T*
( you've been active, what you've done across chains, and how you've behaved during ) Tj
T*
(volatile periods.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Attribution reads that story and turns it into a score. Mintware uses that score to ) Tj
T*
(determine your share of protocol incentives.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## How It Works) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
