(# Attribution ? On-Chain Reputation) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Attribution is Mintware's scoring engine. It analyses your complete on-chain history ) Tj
T*
(across 100+ chains and produces a single composite reputation score that reflects the ) Tj
T*
(quality, depth, and consistency of your wallet activity.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Your score is not based on wealth. A wallet with decades of consistent, diverse on-chain ) Tj
T*
(activity scores higher than a whale who deployed capital yesterday.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## What Gets Measured) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Attribution breaks your wallet history into six independent signal categories:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(| Signal | Max Score | What It Measures |) Tj
T*
(|---|---|---|) Tj
T*
(| **Volume** | 100 | The scale and consistency of your transaction activity over time |) Tj
T*
(| **Trading** | 75 | Your trading behaviour ? frequency, diversity, protocol breadth, and ) Tj
T*
(timing across market conditions |) Tj
T*
(| **Holding** | 100 | Long-term asset conviction ? how long you hold relative to your ) Tj
T*
(entry, and whether you accumulate or churn |) Tj
T*
(| **Liquidity** | 150 | Participation in liquidity provision ? depth, duration, and ) Tj
T*
(quality of your LP positions |) Tj
T*
(| **Governance** | 100 | On-chain governance participation across protocols ? proposals, ) Tj
T*
(votes, and delegation history |) Tj
T*
(| **Sharing** | 400 | The depth and quality of your referral network ? wallets you've ) Tj
T*
(brought on-chain and their downstream activity |) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Each signal is scored independently. They combine into a total Attribution score. ) Tj
T*
(**Maximum possible score: 925.**) Tj
T*
() Tj
