(## How Signals Are Scored) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Each signal uses its own set of behavioural indicators drawn from your raw on-chain ) Tj
T*
(history. The scoring is designed to reward genuine, sustained participation ? not gaming:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- **Recency matters, but history matters more.** Consistent activity over years scores ) Tj
T*
(better than a sudden burst.) Tj
T*
(- **Breadth matters.** Being active across multiple chains and protocols reflects genuine ) Tj
T*
(engagement, not narrow optimisation.) Tj
T*
(- **Quality beats quantity.** Thousands of low-value transactions score lower than ) Tj
T*
(sustained, meaningful activity.) Tj
T*
(- **Sharing is weighted heavily** because building a real referral network that generates ) Tj
T*
(genuine on-chain activity is hard to fake.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The specific weights and formulas are proprietary. What you need to know: the score ) Tj
T*
(rewards being a genuine, long-term DeFi participant.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Score Tiers) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(| Tier | Description |) Tj
T*
(|---|---|) Tj
T*
(| **Bronze** | Emerging on-chain presence ? building history and activity across chains |) Tj
T*
(| **Silver** | Established participant with consistent history and protocol diversity |) Tj
T*
(| **Gold** | Seasoned, long-term wallet with depth across signals |) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Tier thresholds are applied relative to the distribution of all scored wallets ? they ) Tj
T*
(shift as the community grows.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Wallet Character) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Beyond your score, Attribution assigns a **character** to your wallet based on behavioural) Tj
T*
( patterns ? how you respond to volatility, your consistency across bull and bear markets, ) Tj
T*
(and your long-term orientation.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Character labels reflect observed behavioural traits, not judgements. Examples:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- *Ghost* ? active in calm markets, dormant in chaos) Tj
T*
(- *Builder* ? consistent protocol engagement regardless of market conditions) Tj
T*
(- *Liquidity Provider* ? concentrated LP activity and depth) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Character is shown on your profile page and used to surface relevant campaign and protocol) Tj
T*
( opportunities.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Multi-Chain Coverage) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Attribution analyses activity across 100+ EVM and non-EVM chains. You don't need to ) Tj
T*
(migrate assets or bridge anything ? Attribution reads your existing history wherever it ) Tj
T*
(lives.) Tj
T*
