() Tj
T*
(### Token Reward Pools) Tj
T*
(Anyone can create a token reward pool. Rewards are distributed per qualifying swap ) Tj
T*
(transaction ? no epoch, no waiting. Every time you complete a qualifying swap, a reward is) Tj
T*
( locked for your wallet and becomes claimable after a short window.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(**Best for:** Protocols wanting to incentivise immediate trading activity.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### Points Campaigns) Tj
T*
(Points campaigns are created by whitelisted teams. Rewards are distributed per epoch \(a ) Tj
T*
(fixed time window\) based on the actions you complete and your Attribution score ) Tj
T*
(multiplier.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(**Best for:** Protocols running structured loyalty or growth programs.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## How Rewards Are Weighted) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(In Points Campaigns, your Attribution score determines a multiplier applied to your raw ) Tj
T*
(point total. Wallets with higher scores earn a larger share of the epoch pool for the same) Tj
T*
( actions.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(This ensures that protocols reward genuine, established users ? not sybil wallets or one-) Tj
T*
(day-old accounts.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Epoch Distribution) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Points Campaign rewards are settled at the end of each epoch:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Your points are tallied for the epoch) Tj
T*
(2. Your score multiplier is applied) Tj
T*
(3. Your share of the epoch pool is calculated relative to all participants) Tj
T*
(4. A Merkle distribution is published and signed by Mintware's oracle) Tj
T*
(5. You can claim your allocation directly on-chain) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## The Dashboard) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The Mintware dashboard \(`/dashboard`\) shows:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- All live, upcoming, and ended campaigns) Tj
T*
(- Your joined campaigns and pending rewards) Tj
T*
(- Campaign details ? reward pool size, epoch length, qualifying actions) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Access Requirements) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Some Points Campaigns have a minimum Attribution score requirement \(`min_score`\). If your ) Tj
T*
(score is below the threshold, you won't be able to join until your score improves.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
