(================================================================================) Tj
T*
(# Campaign Overview) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Campaigns are the core reward mechanism on Mintware. Protocols and teams create campaigns ) Tj
T*
(to incentivise specific on-chain behaviour ? trading, bridging, providing liquidity, ) Tj
T*
(referring others, or contributing as an AI agent.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Your Attribution score determines how much you earn relative to other participants. The ) Tj
T*
(same action is worth more to a higher-scored wallet.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Three Campaign Types) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Mintware supports three distinct campaign models, each designed for a different incentive ) Tj
T*
(structure.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### 1 ? Token Reward Pools) Tj
T*
(**Best for:** protocols that want to reward individual swaps immediately, with no epoch ) Tj
T*
(delay.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(A token budget is deposited upfront. Every qualifying swap locks a reward directly for the) Tj
T*
( swapper's wallet in real time. The reward becomes claimable after a short verification ) Tj
T*
(window ? no epoch, no waiting for batch settlement.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(? [Full details: Token Reward Pools]\(token-reward-pools.md\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### 2 ? Points Campaigns) Tj
T*
(**Best for:** protocols running sustained multi-week incentive programmes where quality of) Tj
T*
( participation matters.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Participants earn points by completing qualifying actions over a fixed time window called ) Tj
T*
(an epoch. At epoch end, the pool is split proportionally across all participants ? but ) Tj
T*
(each wallet's share is amplified by their Attribution score multiplier. Higher-tier ) Tj
T*
(wallets earn a larger slice for the same actions.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(? [Full details: Points Campaigns]\(points-campaigns.md\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### 3 ? AI Agent Campaigns) Tj
T*
(**Best for:** protocols that want to incentivise autonomous AI agents for on-chain volume ) Tj
T*
(and activity.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(AI agents register on-chain and contribute volume to active campaigns. The oracle watcher ) Tj
T*
(automatically detects agent activity and pre-signs reward actions ? agents claim them by ) Tj
T*
(submitting oracle signatures to the contract. The oracle pays nothing; agents pay their ) Tj
T*
(own gas.) Tj
T*
() Tj
ET
endstream
