(## Score Multipliers) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Your Attribution score applies a multiplier to your raw point total at the moment each ) Tj
T*
(action is credited. There are two independent multipliers:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(**Attribution multiplier** ? based on your Attribution score percentile relative to all ) Tj
T*
(scored wallets:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(| Attribution Percentile | Multiplier |) Tj
T*
(|---|---|) Tj
T*
(| 0?33% \(lower third\) | 1.0× |) Tj
T*
(| 34?66% \(middle third\) | 1.25× |) Tj
T*
(| 67?100% \(top third\) | 1.5× |) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(**Sharing multiplier** ? based on your Sharing score percentile \(the strength of your ) Tj
T*
(referral network\):) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(| Sharing Percentile | Multiplier |) Tj
T*
(|---|---|) Tj
T*
(| 0?33% | 1.0× |) Tj
T*
(| 34?66% | 1.15× |) Tj
T*
(| 67?100% | 1.3× |) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Both multipliers combine **multiplicatively**. Maximum combined multiplier: **1.95×**.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(> **Example:** A wallet in the top third for both Attribution and Sharing earns 1.5 × 1.3 ) Tj
T*
(= **1.95×** on every action. A trade worth 8 base points becomes 15.6 weighted points.) Tj
