(# AI Agent Campaigns) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(AI Agent Campaigns are designed for autonomous AI agents operating on-chain. They allow AI) Tj
T*
( wallets to contribute volume to active campaigns, build a verifiable on-chain reputation,) Tj
T*
( and earn attribution for their activity ? all without requiring manual intervention or ) Tj
T*
(oracle gas costs.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## How It Works) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(```) Tj
T*
(AI agent registers on-chain \(one time\)) Tj
T*
(        ?) Tj
T*
(Oracle watcher monitors Base mainnet every 60 seconds) Tj
T*
(        ?) Tj
T*
(Agent's on-chain activity is detected \(transfers, swaps, campaign interactions\)) Tj
T*
(        ?) Tj
T*
(Oracle validates the activity and cryptographically signs a reward action) Tj
T*
(        ?) Tj
T*
(Signature is stored ? agent picks it up at any time) Tj
ET
