T*
() Tj
T*
(## The Fee Engine) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Fees are not just collected ? they're actively captured. The Mintware V4 hook applies a ) Tj
T*
(dynamic fee that scales with price deviation from the previous block. When price moves ) Tj
T*
(significantly, a larger fee is captured. This is designed to capture value that would ) Tj
T*
(otherwise go to MEV bots exploiting LP positions.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The captured fees flow into the FeeVault, which holds them until epoch close and then ) Tj
T*
(distributes to depositors according to their weighted shares.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Weekly Epoch Distribution) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(At the end of each weekly epoch:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. The vault's total accumulated fees are tallied) Tj
T*
(2. Each depositor's weighted share is calculated \(deposit × lock tier × Attribution × ) Tj
T*
(referral\)) Tj
T*
(3. A Merkle distribution is built and signed by the Mintware oracle) Tj
T*
(4. Depositors can claim their allocation on-chain) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The oracle signature model means Mintware never pays gas to publish distributions. ) Tj
T*
(Depositors pay their own claim gas.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Rebalancing) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Vault liquidity is concentrated within a tick range. When the price moves outside that ) Tj
T*
(range, the vault needs to rebalance. Mintware uses an AI Range Optimizer to propose new ) Tj
T*
(tick ranges based on on-chain price volatility data.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Rebalancing is **permissionless** ? anyone can submit a valid oracle-signed range proposal) Tj
T*
( to the vault contract. The contract verifies the oracle signature before executing. This ) Tj
T*
(avoids centralisation: Mintware can propose ranges, but so can any party with a valid ) Tj
T*
(signed proposal.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Withdrawal) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Withdrawals are subject to the lock tier you selected at deposit. Flexible depositors can ) Tj
T*
(withdraw at any time. Locked depositors who exit early pay a penalty ? the penalty amount ) Tj
T*
(is immediately redistributed to remaining LPs in the same vault.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(After a vault is closed, a cooldown period allows final claims before the creator can ) Tj
T*
(recover remaining funds.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
ET
endstream
