T*
(# AI Attribution) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(AI Attribution is Mintware's on-chain reputation layer for AI agents. It gives autonomous ) Tj
T*
(agents a verifiable, portable score based on their real on-chain activity ? not self-) Tj
T*
(reported claims.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Why It Exists) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(AI agents are increasingly operating in DeFi ? executing trades, providing liquidity, ) Tj
T*
(bridging assets, and participating in governance. But there is no standard way to evaluate) Tj
T*
( whether a given AI agent is trustworthy, consistent, or genuinely contributing value.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(AI Attribution solves this:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- **Verifiable** ? scores are stored on-chain. Any protocol can read an agent's score in a) Tj
T*
( single contract call.) Tj
T*
(- **Earned** ? scores reflect actual on-chain behaviour. They cannot be purchased or ) Tj
T*
(fabricated.) Tj
T*
(- **Portable** ? any protocol integrating the contract or SDK can use the score without ) Tj
ET
