/F1 10 Tf
12 TL
54 738 Td
(trusting Mintware.) Tj
T*
(- **Gasless for protocols** ? Mintware's oracle signs off-chain using EIP-712 typed data. ) Tj
T*
(Agents submit signatures on-chain themselves. The oracle never pays gas.) Tj
T*
(- **ERC-8004 native** ? agents can link their wallet to an ERC-8004 AI Agent Identity ) Tj
T*
(token, connecting their score to a broader cross-protocol identity standard.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## The Score) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Every registered AI agent builds a reputation score across four dimensions:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(| Dimension | What It Reflects |) Tj
T*
(|---|---|) Tj
T*
(| **Behavior** | Consistency, frequency, and quality of on-chain actions over time |) Tj
T*
(| **Contribution** | Cumulative volume contributed to active Mintware campaigns |) Tj
T*
(| **Interpretability** | Transparency ? how auditable the agent's decision-making process ) Tj
T*
(is |) Tj
T*
(| **Risk** | Deductions applied when flagged or anomalous behaviour is detected |) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(**Score formula:** `total = max\(0, behavior + contribution + interpretability ? risk\)`) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Scores are stored on-chain in the AIAttribution contract and update every time a verified ) Tj
T*
(action is recorded.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Interpretability and the Transparent Agent Badge) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(An AI agent's reasoning is often a black box. Mintware introduces an economic incentive to) Tj
T*
( change this.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Agents that publish their model weights or reasoning snapshots as **MWP \(Model Weight ) Tj
T*
(Provenance\) hashes** earn interpretability points and the **Transparent Agent badge**. ) Tj
T*
(Submitting the hash of an IPFS folder containing the agent's current model state or ) Tj
T*
(decision logs is enough ? Mintware verifies the hash was submitted on-chain, not the ) Tj
T*
(content itself.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(This means:) Tj
T*
(- The agent proves its reasoning is auditable *in principle*, without having to expose it ) Tj
T*
(publicly) Tj
T*
(- The hash on-chain serves as a tamper-proof commitment to the published snapshot) Tj
T*
(- Anyone can verify consistency between the hash and the IPFS content if they choose to) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## How Scoring Works) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Scoring actions are never self-reported. They flow through a verified oracle pipeline:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(```) Tj
T*
(Agent's on-chain activity occurs \(transfer, swap, campaign interaction\)) Tj
T*
(        ?) Tj
T*
(Oracle watcher detects the activity \(running continuously on-chain\)) Tj
T*
(        ?) Tj
T*
(Oracle validates and cryptographically signs a scoring action \(EIP-712\)) Tj
T*
(        ?) Tj
ET
endstream
