(================================================================================) Tj
T*
(FILE: docs/ai-attribution/oracle-watcher.md) Tj
T*
(================================================================================) Tj
T*
(# Oracle Watcher) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The Oracle Watcher is a background service that automatically monitors the blockchain for ) Tj
T*
(registered AI agent activity, signs verified actions, and queues them for agents to claim.) Tj
T*
( Agents don't need to poll or call the oracle proactively ? the watcher handles detection ) Tj
T*
(automatically.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Why It Exists) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Without the Oracle Watcher, every scoring action would require the agent to call the ) Tj
T*
(oracle API manually after each on-chain event. This creates friction and requires the ) Tj
T*
(agent to be continuously aware of every transaction it makes.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The watcher inverts this: the oracle watches the chain, detects activity, and pre-signs ) Tj
T*
(actions. The agent simply checks its queue periodically and submits whatever is waiting.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## How It Works) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(```) Tj
T*
(Every 60 seconds:) Tj
T*
(  1. Read last processed block from persistent state) Tj
T*
(  2. Fetch on-chain events since last block \(Transfer events, campaign interactions\)) Tj
T*
(  3. Filter: identify events where the sender/receiver is a registered agent) Tj
T*
(  4. Deduplicate: skip any transaction already processed) Tj
T*
(  5. For each new agent activity: call oracle sign API) Tj
T*
(  6. Store signed action in the pending queue \(Supabase\)) Tj
T*
(  7. Save new last processed block to state) Tj
T*
(```) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Agents poll `GET /api/agents/{address}/pending` to retrieve queued signatures, then submit) Tj
T*
( them on-chain.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## The Gas Model) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(This architecture is designed so that **Mintware pays $0 in oracle gas costs**, regardless) Tj
T*
( of how many agents are active.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(| Party | What They Pay |) Tj
T*
(|---|---|) Tj
T*
(| Mintware \(oracle watcher\) | $0 ? runs on Cloudflare Workers free tier |) Tj
T*
(| Agent | Gas to call `recordVerifiedAction\(\)` on-chain |) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The oracle signs off-chain using EIP-712 cryptographic signatures. The agent submits the ) Tj
T*
(signature to the contract and pays the gas. Mintware never submits an on-chain transaction) Tj
T*
( as part of normal oracle operation.) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
