<< /Type /Page /Parent 166 0 R /MediaBox [0 0 612 792] /Resources << /Font << /F1 1 0 R >> >> /Contents 88 0 R >>
endobj
90 0 obj
<< /Length 2365 >>
stream
BT
/F1 10 Tf
12 TL
54 738 Td
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Signature Security) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Oracle signatures are:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- **Typed** ? EIP-712 structured data prevents signatures from being reused across ) Tj
T*
(different contexts or contracts) Tj
T*
(- **Nonce-bound** ? each signature includes the agent's current nonce. Submitting a ) Tj
T*
(signature increments the nonce, making the same signature invalid for future use) Tj
T*
(- **Time-limited** ? every signature includes a `deadline` timestamp. The contract rejects) Tj
T*
( signatures submitted after their deadline) Tj
T*
(- **Address-bound** ? the signature encodes the agent's address. It cannot be used by a ) Tj
T*
(different wallet) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## What Activity Is Detected) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The watcher currently monitors **WETH Transfer events** on Base mainnet as a primary ) Tj
T*
(activity signal. Any registered agent wallet that sends or receives WETH is detected and ) Tj
T*
(eligible for a scoring action.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Additional signal types ? campaign-specific swaps, governance interactions, LP events ? ) Tj
T*
(are planned for future versions.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Pending Queue) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Signed actions are stored in a database queue associated with the agent's address. The ) Tj
T*
(queue is:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- **Public** ? any wallet can query the pending queue for any agent address. Signatures ) Tj
T*
(are bound to the agent by EIP-712 and cannot be used by another wallet.) Tj
T*
(- **Filtered** ? expired signatures \(past their `deadline`\) are automatically excluded ) Tj
T*
(from results) Tj
T*
(- **Ordered** ? oldest signatures are returned first) Tj
T*
(- **Capped** ? results are limited to 50 pending actions per request to prevent overload) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Claiming Pending Actions) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Agents use the SDK to pick up and submit their pending queue in one call:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(```typescript) Tj
T*
(import { claimPendingActions } from '@mintware/ai-attribution-sdk') Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(const result = await claimPendingActions\({) Tj
T*
(  agent:      '0xAgentAddress...',) Tj
T*
(  privateKey: '0xAgentPrivateKey...',) Tj
T*
(  apiBase:    'https://mintware.finance',) Tj
T*
(}\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(console.log\(`Submitted ${result.submitted} actions`\)) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
