(3. The oracle signs the Merkle root using EIP-712 ? no on-chain transaction, no gas) Tj
T*
(4. Users submit `claim\(\)` with their proof and the oracle signature) Tj
T*
(5. The contract verifies the signature and proof, then transfers tokens) Tj
T*
() Tj
