T*
(| `epochNumber` | Epoch number \(1-indexed\) |) Tj
T*
(| `merkleRoot` | Root of the distribution Merkle tree |) Tj
T*
(| `oracleSignature` | EIP-712 signature from Mintware's oracle |) Tj
T*
