(### Security) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- **Reentrancy guard** on all state-changing functions) Tj
T*
(- **Double-claim protection** ? each `\(campaignId, epochNumber, wallet\)` combination can ) Tj
T*
(only be claimed once) Tj
T*
(- **Oracle signature expiry** ? all distributions have a deadline; expired claims revert) Tj
T*
(- **Chain-specific signatures** ? EIP-712 domain includes `chainId` and ) Tj
T*
(`verifyingContract`, preventing replay across chains) Tj
