(### Gasless Oracle Pattern) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(```) Tj
T*
(1. Agent calls POST /api/agents/campaigns/record with their action) Tj
T*
(2. Oracle validates + signs EIP-712 typed data \(nonce + deadline\)) Tj
T*
(3. Oracle returns: { signature, nonce, deadline }) Tj
T*
(4. Agent calls recordVerifiedAction\(\) on-chain ? agent pays gas) Tj
T*
(5. Contract verifies oracle signature, increments nonce, updates score) Tj
T*
(```) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Oracle never pays gas. Replay protection via per-agent nonce mapping.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### Oracle Rotation \(AIAttribution v3\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The oracle key can be rotated with a 48-hour timelock ? matching the same pattern used in ) Tj
T*
(MintwareDistributor:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(```) Tj
T*
(proposeOracle\(newAddr\)    ? onlyOwner) Tj
T*
(        ?  \(wait 48 hours\)) Tj
T*
(confirmOracle\(\)           ? onlyOwner ? activates new signer) Tj
T*
(        OR) Tj
T*
(cancelOracleRotation\(\)    ? onlyOwner ? abort at any point) Tj
T*
(```) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(`setOracle\(\)` \(instant rotation, v1/v2\) has been removed entirely in v3.) Tj
T*
() Tj
