(================================================================================) Tj
T*
(# EAS Attestations) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Mintware publishes offchain EAS \(Ethereum Attestation Service\) attestations on Base for ) Tj
T*
(key on-chain events. Attestations are cryptographically signed by Mintware's oracle and ) Tj
T*
(verifiable by anyone through the EAS network.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## What Is EAS?) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(EAS is a standard for making verifiable, structured claims about anything on-chain. An ) Tj
T*
(attestation is a signed statement: *"Mintware attests that wallet X has score Y as of date) Tj
T*
( Z."*) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Attestations are:) Tj
T*
(- **Offchain** ? no gas cost to publish) Tj
T*
(- **Verifiable** ? signed by Mintware's oracle; anyone can verify the signature) Tj
T*
(- **Portable** ? any protocol integrating EAS can read and trust Mintware attestations) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Schemas) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Mintware uses four attestation schemas on Base mainnet:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### AttributionScore) Tj
T*
(Records a wallet's Attribution score at a point in time.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(**Schema UID:** `0x98ccb8e2d62e47da0ba7c87302670862a91f18dbbe4712045bf9d0e4176bbdbf`) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(**Fields:**) Tj
T*
(```) Tj
T*
(address wallet) Tj
T*
(uint256 score) Tj
T*
(string tier) Tj
T*
(uint8 percentile) Tj
T*
(uint32 attestedAt) Tj
T*
(```) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### SwapActivity) Tj
T*
(Records a qualifying swap for campaign reward purposes.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(**Schema UID:** `0x6dea22620c8ccce001d64dd6963aa35a7723b83e445c835753ad9d562bdfa5f8`) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(**Fields:**) Tj
T*
(```) Tj
T*
(address wallet) Tj
T*
(string campaignId) Tj
T*
(bytes32 txHash) Tj
T*
(uint256 amountUsd) Tj
T*
(uint32 swappedAt) Tj
T*
(```) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
ET
endstream
