(### Identity / referral) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- connect wallet returns a ref code) Tj
T*
(- referral apply requires wallet consent) Tj
T*
(- connect activates only the connecting wallet's pending referral state) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### Campaigns) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- join works for eligible wallets) Tj
T*
(- create/manage requires creator wallet proof) Tj
T*
(- score refresh does not break participant state) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### Claims) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- claim status loads) Tj
T*
(- claim proof route returns distribution data for eligible wallets) Tj
T*
(- mark-claimed only succeeds on matching distributor calldata) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### Vaults) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- create requires signed auth) Tj
T*
(- deposit requires signed auth and verified deposit tx) Tj
T*
(- withdraw requires signed auth and verified withdrawal tx) Tj
T*
(- rebalance proposal submission only accepts matching on-chain proposal executions) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### Rewards / settlement) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- swap-event rejects unverifiable txs) Tj
T*
(- token-pool pending distributions eventually become published) Tj
T*
(- points epochs advance cleanly) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Operational Rules) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- do not assume a cron comment is true unless the route behavior and `vercel.json` agree) Tj
T*
(- do not assume a database mirror is authoritative if an on-chain source of truth exists) Tj
T*
(- do not assume a wallet address in a request body proves ownership) Tj
T*
(- do not enable half-wired economics in production just because the contract surface ) Tj
T*
(exists) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## External Audit Boundary) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(If paying for a focused external review later, scope the money-bearing core first:) Tj
